    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Solo Horror Card Game </strong> Set in the 1950s: Abducted and isolated in a mysterious, eerie setting, you must use your wits to escape and survive. Crafted by shadowy figures with unknown motives, this card game plunges you into a chilling adventure filled with suspense and peril in a bygone era.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.poster.avif?t=1736658945\" width=506 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.webm?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.mp4?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>In Snatched You Will...</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get Abducted by the Snatchers - (Story Mode)<br></li><li> Acquire a deck of WW1 and WW2 Based Cards at the start of each Russian Rootlet Based Round<br></li><li> Fight for your life against another Victim by playing a game of Snatched<br></li><li> Set off on a journey that is as profoundly unsettling as it is <i>unexpected</i> in our game<br></li><li> A Group of <i>Masked </i> men will deliver you to a hidden abandoned destination where you're forced against your will at gun point to play Snatched (A Game of Cards)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.poster.avif?t=1736658945\" width=334 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.webm?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.mp4?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Gameplay and Features</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story Mode will be available later at EA release, allowing you to experience a brief narrative on how you were initially abducted.<br></li><li> Early Access release will feature the core game, &quot;Snatched,&quot; a card game driven by RNG where you compete for your life in a shower room, facing another victim at gunpoint, with the same amount of luck. <br></li><li> Matches can go either way, you either lose and get shot or you win and play to live another day<br></li><li> Each Map where you play cards (you've been abducted already) will feature a certain atmosphere, the first one releasing at EA release is called &quot;Shower Room&quot; This is where you will be forced to play the card game known as Snatched in this Universe.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A Solo Horror Card Game </strong> Set in the 1950s: Abducted and isolated in a mysterious, eerie setting, you must use your wits to escape and survive. Crafted by shadowy figures with unknown motives, this card game plunges you into a chilling adventure filled with suspense and peril in a bygone era.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.poster.avif?t=1736658945\" width=506 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.webm?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/4541ab4fb2219c57ade334af30f2b321.mp4?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>In Snatched You Will...</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get Abducted by the Snatchers - (Story Mode)<br></li><li> Acquire a deck of WW1 and WW2 Based Cards at the start of each Russian Rootlet Based Round<br></li><li> Fight for your life against another Victim by playing a game of Snatched<br></li><li> Set off on a journey that is as profoundly unsettling as it is <i>unexpected</i> in our game<br></li><li> A Group of <i>Masked </i> men will deliver you to a hidden abandoned destination where you're forced against your will at gun point to play Snatched (A Game of Cards)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.poster.avif?t=1736658945\" width=334 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.webm?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968640/extras/c949f616598b9511e147e2e2312bed61.mp4?t=1736658945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Gameplay and Features</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story Mode will be available later at EA release, allowing you to experience a brief narrative on how you were initially abducted.<br></li><li> Early Access release will feature the core game, &quot;Snatched,&quot; a card game driven by RNG where you compete for your life in a shower room, facing another victim at gunpoint, with the same amount of luck. <br></li><li> Matches can go either way, you either lose and get shot or you win and play to live another day<br></li><li> Each Map where you play cards (you've been abducted already) will feature a certain atmosphere, the first one releasing at EA release is called &quot;Shower Room&quot; This is where you will be forced to play the card game known as Snatched in this Universe.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
