        "notes": "[i]This game contains mature themes and graphic content that some players might find disturbing. Players are thrust into a high-stakes scenario where their character is abducted and forced to participate in a card game at gunpoint. The game setting includes graphic scenes of violence and blood, with visible remnants of previous players who did not survive. There are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, or drug and alcohol abuse; however, the intense theme of coercion and life-threatening situations may be sensitive for some audiences. This content is integral to the game's storyline and atmosphere.[/i]"
